Digitalis prebuilts, redistributed with Refract so the ARM64 translator does not have to
be built from AOSP source.

Digitalis / Berberis (system/lib64/libberberis_*, system/bin/berberis_program_runner_*,
system/etc/*): Apache License 2.0. Berberis is part of the Android Open Source Project:
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/libs/binary_translation/
system/lib64/libberberis_arm64.so includes Refract's change in
tools/translator/digitalis-performance-fix.patch.

arm64 guest libraries (system/lib64/arm64/*, system/bin/arm64/*): built from the Android
Open Source Project. Each keeps its upstream license: mostly Apache License 2.0; bionic
(libc, libm, libdl, linker) BSD-style; ICU (libicu*) Unicode License; BoringSSL
(libcrypto, libssl) OpenSSL/ISC; zlib (libz) zlib License; SQLite (libsqlite) public
domain; libc++ Apache 2.0 with LLVM exception. Full texts are in the AOSP source tree
(https://source.android.com/), under each project's LICENSE or NOTICE file.

